  <region left="18" top="2545" width="500" height="56" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
    <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 3: Cross-Property Inversion &amp; State Verification</p>
    <p bold="true">Verification of inverse relations and cross-dependencies across the 40 PsychroLib functions.</p>
    </content>
  </text>
  </region>
  <region left="18" top="2613" width="44" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <math>
