    <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 4: HVAC Cooling and Dehumidification Coil Simulation</p>
    <p bold="true">Air handling unit (AHU) cooling coil simulation conditioning 2.5 kg/s of fresh outdoor air.</p>
    <p bold="true">Air enters at 32 °C, 65% RH and is cooled below its dew point to an apparatus dew point (ADP) of 10 °C with BF = 0.12.</p>
    </content>
