    <p bold="true">Visualization 3: Moist Air Enthalpy Isotherms h(T)</p>
    <p bold="true">Specific enthalpy profiles comparing saturated moist air (100% RH), typical indoor/outdoor air (50% RH), and dry air (0% RH).</p>
    </content>
